    555, TODO, runtime, P2, "Add a runtime-owned deferred Metal completion quarantine/reaper for submissions that remain unknown during backend shutdown.", src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/io/metal_sffi.spl, 59, , "runtime facade owns parallel command/encoder/source/framebuffer quarantine and immediate uncommitted cleanup; all five Engine2D dispatch paths distinguish registry-missing commit failure from committed-but-unknown completion. A standalone four-case interpreter unit proves the pure release policy: retain unknown/unknown, release after wait success, release after terminal registry removal, and monotonic release when both proofs exist. The strict no-dispatch probe now requires an exact device/queue/command create-destroy registry roundtrip after the interpreter exposed that missing lifecycle externs can be coerced to false and fake the unknown-handle oracle. Three native builds failed before entry loading and the three-cycle interpreter cap is reached; current host-GPU native execution remains required", open, true
