    565, TODO, simpleos, P1, "Complete AArch64 and RISC-V production desktops through the canonical SharedWmScene, Engine2D, and Engine2dWmFrameExecutor host-GPU path using architecture-owned framebuffer, input, and ivshmem adapters.", src/os/compositor/engine2d_wm_frame_executor.spl, 1, , "AArch64 and RISC-V canonical production sources/scenarios are present; RV64 reuses initialized nonblocking serial input plus shared WmAction mapping, rerenders changed state through the canonical executor, and requires checked VirtIO present without WFI because UART IER is zero. RV64 process ownership is integrated in source. Fresh compiled/QEMU PID/frame proof is gated by TODO666 then TODO667, retained by TODO809 and composed through TODO806; TODO567 separately owns pure-Simple DMA.", open, true
