    570, TODO, gpu, P1, "Measure ProcessingIR device time against the independent CPU oracle and classify correct device results below 1.5x speedup as available-not-preferred.", src/app/simpleos_gpu_host/daemon_runner.spl, 68, , "the source-matched daemon-wire gate passes 3 warmups plus 5 measured exact 1048576-element CUDA requests with stable positive provenance and no fallback. Medians are 155110 us device, 312012 us round trip, 156902 us non-device overhead, and 82097 us independent CPU oracle; every receipt is correctly classified available-not-preferred", done, false
